gaLD(){return'Tags let you view analysis for a specific sub-portfolio.\n\n\u2022 "All" shows your entire portfolio \u2014 default view\n\u2022 Tap one or more tags to filter \u2014 stocks in any selected tag are included\n\u2022 VaR and History only support a single tag at a time\n\u2022 Assign tags to stocks in each stock\'s Edit screen'},
gaLE(){return"Exit vs the round's peak"},
